message: >-
  DRAFT, not yet valid for citation: authors, version and release date are
  still to be confirmed by the owner. If you use this software, please cite
  it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: Lab Trajectory Explorer
abstract: >-
  Browser application for research on longitudinal laboratory values, with
  a focus on kidney function: import of laboratory exports, derived eGFR,
  per-patient trend estimation, KDIGO creatinine AKI screening, observed and
  projected kidney endpoints, and cohort mixed models in R (webR). Research
  use only; not a medical device and not for clinical decision-making.
